  "prefLabel": "Ac 102.09 Financial Statement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 102.09 “Financial Statement” means a document and related footnotes that purports to represent actual or prospective financial positions at a particular time, or results of operations, cash flow, or changes in financial position for a period of time, in conformity with generally accepted accounting principles or another comprehensive basis of accounting.\n\nSource. #10053, eff 1-1-12 from Ac 101.08); renumbered by #13995 (formerly Ac 102.08)",
